        "id": "98CB4717-1ED5-4114-A499-3B4D556B926A",
        "body": "Take one core message and adapt it for each platform's native format:\n\n**Instagram (feed post):** Visual-first. Write a caption that starts with a hook line, uses line breaks, and ends with a question. Suggest image style.\n\n**Twitter/X:** Compress to 280 characters. Prioritize wit or a hot take. No hashtags in the main tweet — save them for a reply.\n\n**LinkedIn:** Expand into a short narrative. First line must create curiosity. Write in first person.\n\n**TikTok:** Script a 15-second video. Text on screen plus voiceover. End with a hook to watch part 2.\n\n**Email newsletter:** 3-paragraph version with a personal anecdote and one clear CTA.\n\nEach version must feel like it was written for that platform, not repurposed.",
