        "id": "6B11F0D4-2DCF-4853-86A2-6082AE64698C",
        "body": "Conduct an operational efficiency audit across the organization. For each department or function:\n\n1. **Process inventory** — List the top 5 processes by time or cost consumption\n2. **Bottleneck identification** — Where do delays, handoff failures, or rework occur?\n3. **Automation potential** — Which manual tasks could be automated and with what tools?\n4. **Headcount utilization** — Are people spending time on high-value work or administrative overhead?\n5. **Tool and system redundancy** — Identify overlapping software licenses or duplicate data entry\n6. **Quick wins** — Changes that can be implemented within 30 days with minimal investment\n7. **Strategic improvements** — Larger initiatives requiring budget approval and 3-6 months to implement\n\nSummarize total estimated savings in hours per week and annual cost reduction.",
