        "id": "D1AD8B8D-EC4A-4C90-B7F4-99DF461E9F8C",
        "body": "Audit a post for engagement bait and rewrite it for genuine interaction:\n\n**Red flags to check:**\n- 'Like if you agree' or 'Share if you care' — platforms penalize these\n- Vague emotional hooks with no real content behind them\n- Asking for comments with single-word responses (YES/NO, emoji reactions)\n- Misleading thumbnails or text that don't match the content\n- Rage bait designed to provoke argument, not discussion\n\n**Rewrite principles:**\n1. Replace 'like if' with a genuine question that invites a story\n2. Replace clickbait hooks with specific, honest previews of value\n3. Replace 'comment YES' with open-ended prompts that require thought\n4. Replace emotional manipulation with authentic vulnerability\n\n**The goal:** Posts that earn engagement through value, not tricks. Algorithms increasingly reward meaningful interaction over hollow metrics.",
