      {
        "id": "F19BDFF7-4D1D-4B55-AA2F-FF02EB15EAB1",
        "body": "Write a cross-platform design brief for {{product:a task management app}} shipping on iOS, Android, and web.\n\nAddress:\n1. **Shared DNA** — Brand colors, typography, iconography, and tone of voice that stay consistent\n2. **Platform-native patterns** — Navigation (tab bar on iOS, bottom nav on Android, sidebar on web), back gestures, system fonts\n3. **Component mapping** — How each shared component adapts (e.g. action sheet on iOS → bottom sheet on Android → dropdown on web)\n4. **Spacing and sizing** — 44pt tap targets on iOS, 48dp on Android, hover states on web\n5. **Platform features** — Widgets, Dynamic Island, Android shortcuts, PWA capabilities\n\nDeliver a comparison matrix with three columns (iOS, Android, Web) for the ten most common patterns.",
        "displayOrder": 0
      }
